(LEGAL-016 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: NGT Southern Zone Original Application No. 125 of 2020 \(SZ\)  Prevention of) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: District Collector Chengalpattu, Commissioner Tambaram City Municipal Corporation & TNPCB District Environmental Engineer) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Para 22 & Direction \(a\) \(Zero Untreated Sewage & Solid Waste in Tanks\)) Tj T*
(The Tribunal directed the Chengalpattu District Collector, Water Resources) Tj T*
(Department, and local bodies to immediately plug all unauthorised storm-water) Tj T*
(drains discharging untreated domestic sewage or septage into Sembakkam,) Tj T*
(Medavakkam, and Perumbakkam irrigation tanks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Direction \(c\) \(Environmental Compensation under Polluter Pays Principle\)) Tj T*
(The Tamil Nadu Pollution Control Board \(TNPCB\) is mandated to levy Environmental) Tj T*
(Compensation under Section 5 of the Environment \(Protection\) Act and the Water) Tj T*
(\(Prevention and Control of Pollution\) Act, 1974 against any local body or) Tj T*
(commercial establishment dumping construction debris \(C&D waste\) or garbage on) Tj T*
(tank bunds and foreshores.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
